Meeting invitation, update and cancellation emails are now sent to invited email addresses when a meeting is created, edited, its join link refreshed or it is deleted. Galley only triggers them (`settings.meetings.emailsEnabled` + the deployment license covering meeting emails); brig renders them from its `emailSMS` templates (branding, sender, SES/SMTP transport) and sends them, with an optional `emailSMS.general.meeting.replyTo` Reply-To header.
